## 4.4 Component View (C4 Level 3)

Diagram komponen memperlihatkan struktur internal sebuah layanan Go yang representatif (menerapkan Clean/Hexagonal Architecture — BRD 13.9.2).

```mermaid
C4Component
  title Component View — Struktur Internal Layanan Go (representatif)

  Container_Boundary(svc, "Contoh: ar-service (Go)") {
    Component(rest, "REST Handler", "Go + chi/gin", "Endpoint publik via Kong")
    Component(grpc, "gRPC Handler", "Go", "Antarmuka sinkron internal")
    Component(uc, "Use Case / App Service", "Go", "Orkestrasi logika bisnis")
    Component(dom, "Domain Model", "Go", "Entity, value object, business rule")
    Component(repo, "Repository", "Go + pgx/sqlc", "Akses PostgreSQL")
    Component(outbox, "Event Publisher", "Go", "Transactional Outbox → Kafka")
    Component(consumer, "Event Consumer", "Go", "Idempotent handler + retry/DLQ")
    Component(mw, "Middleware", "Go", "AuthN/AuthZ, scope, tracing, logging")
  }

  ContainerDb(db, "ar_db", "PostgreSQL", "")
  ContainerQueue(k, "Kafka", "", "")

  Rel(rest, mw, "melalui")
  Rel(grpc, mw, "melalui")
  Rel(mw, uc, "memanggil")
  Rel(uc, dom, "menggunakan")
  Rel(uc, repo, "menggunakan")
  Rel(repo, db, "SQL (tx)")
  Rel(uc, outbox, "menulis event (tx yang sama)")
  Rel(outbox, k, "publish")
  Rel(consumer, k, "subscribe")
  Rel(consumer, uc, "memanggil")
```

Pola ini seragam di seluruh layanan sehingga menurunkan beban kognitif dan meningkatkan *maintainability* (ARC-010, NFR-013/015). Penulisan *event* dilakukan dalam transaksi yang sama dengan perubahan data (ADR-008).

